# =============================================================================
# EXPERIMENT DECLARATION — phase2_baseline   (scaffolded by `api.py declare`)
#
# This file is YOURS until `reconstruct.py` seals it: edit the label, trim
# add setting overrides. After assessment the student section is
# digest-sealed — a new idea is a NEW file under a NEW name (§3.1).
#
# PREDICTION (write BEFORE assessing — the seal makes it non-retractable):
#   pipeline: All 281 RGB-D pairs should have measured factors. Missing/noisy
#             depth in spatial uncertainty zones and viewpoint changes during
#             turns may reduce geometric support and pair registration quality.
#   baseline: Expect a recognizable map with possible drift; evaluate the full
#             capture without frame selection. No numeric score is assumed.
#   collection: Actual automatic NavMesh-guided discrete actions, not manual
#               keyboard input and not teleport replay; see capture_metadata.json.
#   treatment: voxel_size_m=0.05; registration_seed=0; icp_backend=open3d.
# =============================================================================

